%   data: {"dataType":"text","outputData":{"text":"目标 C 教学特例：二阶锥松弛不精确。请比较模型电压与交流潮流电压，并分析松弛间隙和交流电压越限。\n","truncated":false}}
%---
%[output:94e6152e]
%   data: {"dataType":"text","outputData":{"text":"    StudentID          Case         Objective    Solver     Curtailment_MWh    Loss_MWh    GridCost_Yuan    MaxConeGap    SimultaneousPower_MW    MinACVoltage    MaxACVoltage\n    __________    ______________    _________    _______    _______________    ________    _____________    __________    ____________________    ____________    ____________\n\n    2.0923e+08    \"case_nongcun\"       \"C\"       \"mosek\"      -4.6697e-08       1.865          28604        0.0022735              0                  0.95           1.0623   \n\n","truncated":false}}
